{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "d513300461f90b3e6cbfcf14f0e73d7cb2da9d4ae7b38dc8a681b82fa53a44d5", "ja": "社長さんと音無先輩、あとお姉ちゃんでしょ。\nそれと……{$P$}さん！", "zh": "还有社长、音无前辈，以及姐姐。\n还有……{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "053542e4a716a46fe1a445ac93cf76d45d4ed4748ff91b2db3a699aad9094854", "ja": "はい、何でしょう？", "zh": "是，有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "8302aa74456370b878a9b5b27bb02f79d7496528ca72417c25bb4d7fab90ef20", "ja": "へっ？　{$P$}さん！？\nお、お疲れさまです！", "zh": "诶？{$P$}先生！？\n您、您辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_intro_1003_p", "source_sha256": "755386de00bb0b0afd705e95ab7667342d3ef8d20b0e1f99613212411e5741c3", "ja": "お疲れさまです、青羽さん。\n何か用事でもありましたか？", "zh": "辛苦了，青羽小姐。\n是有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "a2c0cca82c8f0997cad87c8505c9f0a679466669c690c3c5be051bc21f4b5101", "ja": "い、いえ。チョコを渡す人を考えてて……ああっ！\nすみません……今のは忘れてください！", "zh": "不、不是。我正在想要把巧克力送给谁……啊！\n对不起……刚才那句话请忘了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "607169b80099c0385ca289116b9cedfb362da333add8a90a668659cfa793ac6b", "ja": "すごいチョコを渡して、\nみんなをビックリさせようと思ってたのに、ううっ。", "zh": "我本来想送出一份超棒的巧克力，让大家大吃一惊的，呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_intro_1006_p", "source_sha256": "3cff084287bab47e2a2e0a0654fd454891c3ca3c9161f1837b2090e3331e12c1", "ja": "わ、わかりました。青羽さんがそういうなら、\n今聞いたことは忘れます。", "zh": "我、我知道了。既然青羽小姐都这么说了，\n那我就忘掉刚才听到的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_intro_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "50494778710ac1ec3a353982b3a2cd88a76a2d788292673879b2a821a0815523", "ja": "ありがとうございます、{$P$}さん。\n私も、うっかりしないように気をつけ……あっ。", "zh": "谢谢您，{$P$}先生。\n我也会注意不再粗心大意……啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_intro_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "9a31d0edf0c0fee83a4af27529e66089282eab09b7fd9ebea0559fc21f1dcc40", "ja": "うっかりしてました！　社長さんからお電話があって\n「チョコっと事務所にきてほしい」と伝言が……。", "zh": "我差点给忘了！社长之前打过电话来，\n留言说“想让你顺便（巧）来一趟事务所”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_intro_1009_p", "source_sha256": "f551eea64628fc1a1116d31a6fd904846f60f6415f3dac4b10e47ab5de863ce8", "ja": "チョコっと？\n……わかりました。事務所に行ってみますね。", "zh": "来办公室一小会儿？……明白了。我去办公室看看吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_intro_1010_102mis", "source_sha256": "241d5cf08dbca2492c5e6ddd0f460cd8ceba8907d32f6009222b4c98071ea27c", "ja": "はーい、行ってらっしゃーい♪\nうっかりしないように気をつけなきゃ……。", "zh": "好——路上小心♪  \n可得注意别粗心大意了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_intro_1011_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_intro_1012_p", "source_sha256": "56fbd644f6fba06011b3419b034d1035882f24e3a542021f185fc9ace7b2167f", "ja": "お疲れさまです。\nお呼びだと聞きましたが……。", "zh": "辛苦了。\n听说您叫我过来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_intro_1013_president", "source_sha256": "fe2658438bb3657f3626b01d449431ac2029f4838a9be9c7ad830e520a5a682b", "ja": "やあ、君！　突然だが、もういくつ寝ると\n何の日になるか……君は知っているかね？", "zh": "呀，是你啊！虽然有点突然，但再过几天\n会是什么日子……你知道吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_intro_1014_p", "source_sha256": "e0d22c94bec1cfc2dd8dcd058268fbfc7ae47cd7f73af1cef667c78d39b094da", "ja": "えっ？　お正月はもう過ぎましたが……\n2月ですし、バレンタインでしょうか？", "zh": "咦？新年已经过去了……现在是2月，所以应该是情人节吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_intro_1015_101kot", "source_sha256": "2d0013cd530febc838267653ef919440dfc91d197567a16bad4fae9bb538f9a9", "ja": "正解です♪　乙女には欠かせない一大イベント……\n胸をときめかせ、意中のあの人に……キャッ♪", "zh": "答对了♪ 这是少女们不可或缺的大型活动……\n让人心跳加速，送给心仪的那个人……呀♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_intro_1016_president", "source_sha256": "e3f1dd0f8b94c064f8d0178045dbee9eb6685e84ff27c2bf15c0fed7e1adaccc", "ja": "音無君がいつになく盛り上がっているように、\n今回はバレンタインに関連した企画だ。", "zh": "正如音无一反常态地兴奋起来一样，\n这次是与情人节相关的企划。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_intro_1017_president", "source_sha256": "1c5f82ee7e45161d967b4f551d72efcaa06fb34fe8efed0bfde4d385cba01032", "ja": "懇意にしている製菓会社から、アイドル諸君と\nコラボイベントがしたい、と連絡があってね。", "zh": "有一家关系密切的糕点公司联系了我，说想和偶像们合作举办活动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_intro_1018_p", "source_sha256": "99a6e8750e7936ce94225fd189db39377c3dfeb3e1794f040e457ac5529d7b80", "ja": "アイドルと製菓会社のコラボ……！", "zh": "偶像和那家糕点公司的联动……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_intro_1019_president", "source_sha256": "70eb53129fdab280051ec2633f922ad194633e42c018e48fb4f4f4b5ac1fa860", "ja": "うむ！　アイドル諸君の手作りチョコレートを、\nイベントの来場者に配りたいという企画なんだ。", "zh": "嗯！这是个想把偶像们亲手制作的巧克力分发给活动来宾的企划。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_intro_1020_101kot", "source_sha256": "674ff1ba1c2a962e9edbf63265e5afb2639e68fdf1b8f19183741128783e8ed9", "ja": "でも、ただ配るだけじゃないんですよ！\nその場で調理しているところも見てもらうんです。", "zh": "但是，并不是只把巧克力分发出去哦！\n还要让大家看看现场制作巧克力的过程。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_intro_1021_101kot", "source_sha256": "dcca503e6af876959348b6e435c54fc530b32c158708184e0a82a8f899a1a8fd", "ja": "最初はチョコを配るだけだったのに、\n社長の提案で、いつの間にか大きなイベントに……。", "zh": "本来只是打算分发巧克力，\n没想到社长一提议，不知不觉就变成了大型活动……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_intro_1022_president", "source_sha256": "44523410352831d9d69d8f3210b15c3f1c3ed2cb383b48449cd93e79025e20b4", "ja": "いやなに、『クッキング大運動会』が大好評だったのを\n思い出してね。チョコっと口を出しただけだよ。", "zh": "没什么，只是想起了之前大受好评的\n“料理大运动会”而已。我就顺便提了点建议罢了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_intro_1023_p", "source_sha256": "f58268a0e5ac8abf9fcc78e0308d88dc52df7a3c56d865e3a4e9be0d8d34ab37", "ja": "さすが、社長です。\n魅力的なイベントだと思います！", "zh": "不愧是社长。\n我觉得这是个很有吸引力的活动！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_intro_1024_101kot", "source_sha256": "e2a04538e2a244d5ec35610f0f03a8429efb1d7244e7c8a9bd5818ccd1cda584", "ja": "応援しているアイドルの皆からチョコレートを\nもらえるなんて、夢のような企画ですよね♪", "zh": "能从支持的偶像们那里收到巧克力，\n真是像做梦一样的企划呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_intro_1025_president", "source_sha256": "69d5b320168a5c33c852f06a7c0880417e7c98ea1670e5dfda8a7e3c7ddf4be4", "ja": "見て良し、食べて良し！　そしてステージも楽しむ。\n五感をフル活用したダイナミックなイベントだ！", "zh": "看得开心，吃得开心！还能欣赏舞台表演。\n这是一个充分调动五感的精彩活动！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_intro_1026_president", "source_sha256": "2dceb3d7e0b89e4f5743f7a2b31cf9098833aa7370ca3bb8b90f668b5e57c322", "ja": "この企画、君に進めてもらおうと考えているが……\nやってもらえるかな？", "zh": "这个企划，我想交给你来推进……可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_intro_1027_p", "source_sha256": "c143f246bcae4eb74d4c170b13b9dd451cd2753d3dc7df73af188aa77a0df1db", "ja": "任せてください！\n必ずイベントを成功させてみせます！", "zh": "交给我吧！\n我一定会让活动取得成功！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_intro_1028_101kot", "source_sha256": "08d64668d14005d3523caa4d292cf87a57344e869daa09f056e1639d4644daa3", "ja": "頑張ってくださいね、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "请加油，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_intro_1029_p", "source_sha256": "47378f984983729edf5c8e0852946533975e4f671bb18c79734b874bec80cda6", "ja": "（アイドル総出演のバレンタインイベント……\n前代未聞のバレンタインになりそうだな！）", "zh": "（所有偶像参加的情人节活动……看来会成为前所未有的情人节了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
